00:42:13,333 --> 00:42:19,333
Barbie: Fairytopia is a 2005 animated fantasy film directed by Walter P.

11
00:46:26,666 --> 00:46:32,666
Martishius and William Lau and written by Elise Allen and Diane Duane.

12
00:50:40,000 --> 00:50:46,000
The film first premiered on 6 March 2005, before
releasing direct-to-video on VHS and DVD.

13
00:54:53,333 --> 00:54:59,333
It was distributed internationally through Universal
Pictures Video and Entertainment Rights.

14
00:59:06,666 --> 00:59:12,666
The fifth installment in the Barbie film series and the first to have an original
storyline, it is based on the Fairytopia Mattel toy line introduced in 2003.

15
01:03:20,000 --> 01:03:26,000
The film follows Elina, a wingless flower fairy who goes on a journey to save
the enchanted land of Fairytopia from the evil fairy Laverna.

16
01:07:33,333 --> 01:07:39,333
The film is followed by two sequels; Barbie: Mermaidia and Barbie Fairytopia: Magic of the
Rainbow and two spin-offs; Barbie: Mariposa and Barbie: Mariposa & the Fairy Princess.

17
01:11:46,666 --> 01:11:52,666
The film explores themes of magic, fairy, mermaid,
based on toy, female protagonist.
